/P 211 0 R
/E (This proposal introduces an AI Financial Health Assistant, a proactive intelligence layer that continuously analyzes a user's financial behavior to identify early indicators of financial stress before they escalate into overdrafts, missed bill payments, high-interest borrowing, or credit score deterioration.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
